            "notes": "only get blessed boosters if you are on a good map for it, have enough cash to also get a wp item, and don't fear that it will get you killed by hitscan. This build isn't ap focused, whambulance is just an added extra healing power that adds to mercy's already insane healing output with amaris antidote and booster jets. Then you throw in angelic acrobatics and suddenly you are able to fly to your teammates when they are crit more consistently. 15% ap was added to angelic acrobatics this season so we can make good use of that added ap by taking whambulance. Valk pocket with this build is disgustingly good.",
