        {
            "id": "5a9cd325-df0e-4d3d-884f-7c12e67aeca0",
            "build_id": "e13e8188-9a8b-4f1f-991c-f29b8f2b34fd",
            "round_number": 7,
            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-08-31T01:05:55.217051+00:00",
            "notes": "replace hardlight accelerator with eye of spider if you want more consistent wp and have the cash. Also consider not focusing too hard on increasing your wp ap or as because it will be the last round where you need to prioritize making the biggest game changing plays which tend to come from rez. So don't be afraid to get an item like resurrection finder or some different survival items over hardlight accel to help guarantee the rez over trying to outheal the tremendous amounts of damage people will be dealing with their maxed out builds. You decide based on the heroes you are against and how the enemies are playing. Hard focusing ur rezzes? camping them? bursting you down quickly? maybe its better to go for nebula plus some other kind of survival item instead of hardlight accel. Serenity is great even after nerfs especially in round 7 where you will be taking alot of damage. But her new power supply surge also can synergize very well with round 7 builds and threads of fate so I think that can be just as viable in the right circumstances. First responder and renaissance are good but they are powers you only get value from on a complete rez which may only happen 2-3 times in a round unless you get more lucky. I still consider them as optional picks tho alongside distortion that can be very powerful round 7 where your teammates will be dealing alot of dmg making the lifesteal from it more signficant in keeping them alive.",
